<title>USA: BIG Entertainment Jan. same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>BIG Entertainment Jan. same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG Entertainment Inc said same store sales for the month of January rose by 20.5 percent, compared with January of last year.</p>
<p>The company did not give specific figures. It said its sales for all stores rose 94.5 percent for the period.</p>
<p>For the fourth quarter, the company said its same-store sales rose 24.4 percent, compared with the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>Officials at the company were not available to comment further.</p>
</text>
